A '''Honeybuzz''' is a [[Critter]] that can spawn from [[Honeyhives]] on the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Honeybuzz''' has a {{Chance|50%|1|2}} chance<ref>{{Cite Discord|staff=y|url=https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1534957830271012924|user=mrkeith|date=8/6/26, 12:14 PM (EST)|text=50%, it either happens or it doesn't}}</ref> to be spawned from opening up a [[Honeyhive]] on the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}}.

